{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Soulmask V1.0 &amp; 'Shifting Sands' DLC will Arrive globally on April 10, 2026!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/5ab8d1170979625018b70395caea4044.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" width=614 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/5ab8d1170979625018b70395caea4044.webm?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/5ab8d1170979625018b70395caea4044.mp4?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulmask is a massive survival crafting game set in  multidimensional ancient civilization open worlds. Carve your path through two unique realms\u2014[Cloud Mist Forest] or [Shifting Sands]. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a survivor whose soul is tied to a mysterious mask. To survive this world, you must recruit the strongest barbarians, using the masks to possess and lead them toward a new era of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/17d1c32a5bb84691b70bb0044653ef01.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" width=614 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/17d1c32a5bb84691b70bb0044653ef01.webm?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/17d1c32a5bb84691b70bb0044653ef01.mp4?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Barbarians with Unique Talents</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Soulmask, no two souls are alike. With over 400 unique Talents, Masteries, and Likes, your tribesmen offer infinite possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From bloodthirsty warriors and lethal hunters to legendary craftsmen and master harvesters\u2014recruit them all. Transfer your consciousness through the mask to possess any tribesman, transforming them into your ultimate avatar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 1.0 update allows your barbarians to share their wisdom. Train your tribesmen and pass down skills to forge the ultimate, one-of-a-kind warrior.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/72ea7b55c35eaac1906be9dff753b302.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" width=614 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/72ea7b55c35eaac1906be9dff753b302.webm?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/72ea7b55c35eaac1906be9dff753b302.mp4?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Production, Tribe Management &amp; Base Building</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrace the ascent of civilization: from humble thatch huts to impenetrable blackstone forts. Watch as your small settlement evolves into a majestic city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the first seeds of agriculture to the roar of machinery\u2014experience the true evolution of civilization in Soulmask through farming, beekeeping, weaving, leatherworking, smelting, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not walk this path alone. With a sophisticated command system, your tribesmen can automate every task. From gathering raw materials to managing logistics and assembly lines, you can design and transform your home into a fully automated industrial powerhouse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/63206c48b4e1241326a072a8552c3a08.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" width=614 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/63206c48b4e1241326a072a8552c3a08.webm?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/63206c48b4e1241326a072a8552c3a08.mp4?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Masks and Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the Mask is a symbol of the gods. Each Mask grants a unique combat style, while the Mimicry System lets you embody a deity to turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 9 weapon classes, 88 weapon skills, and the infinite traits of your tribesmen, each battle is a thrilling test of skill to be experienced as you fight for survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/83c537121e6e820921a0f96eb03ed283.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" width=614 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/83c537121e6e820921a0f96eb03ed283.webm?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/83c537121e6e820921a0f96eb03ed283.mp4?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Massive Ancient Open World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore two ancient worlds spanning great distances, each with unique climates and ecosystems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rainforests, deserts, snow-capped mountains, plateaus, and islands that you must adapt to... or perish. Each environment demands different strategies for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for treasure in ancient ruins, battle mechanical enemies in labyrinths, or take on entire barbarian cities alone. This world is yours to challenge and explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/73c04340f3bfa11b9338f1b42d907ff3.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" width=614 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/73c04340f3bfa11b9338f1b42d907ff3.webm?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/73c04340f3bfa11b9338f1b42d907ff3.mp4?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your gameplay, Your experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom is at the heart of Soulmask.  Single-player play, LAN(Co-op), Private, or Official Servers, over 200 customizable settings allow you to craft a world that is uniquely yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In v1.0, we introduce three distinct playstyles: Tribe Mode for the builders and leaders; Survival Mode for the purists; and Warrior Mode for those who seek the thrill of brutal combat. Choose your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Steam Workshop and everyone can now unleash their creativity with our powerful Soulmask Modkits to craft a Soulmask experience unlike any other.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Soulmask","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2646460/dfb3427936178af7e7f5ac7517a2035287f2df85.jpg"},{"name":"It's getting better.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2646460/0a7a09584625d85ed398e29cd7ed0bd6eb17a075.jpg"},{"name":"More, better, farther","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2646460/ba1035454e438368656cf2be2a4318faad1cac17.jpg"},{"name":"Iron and Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2646460/27ba1b73d51003101154974c8e2f8887166d4b49.jpg"},{"name":"Stacked Civilizations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2646460/64840671d9ce3f411c132c00a6bb213f4c6daeaa.jpg"},{"name":"Do not respond!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2646460/7f95a1ddbb95f855f1fdfe48e2e9965c880a252a.jpg"},{"name":"Ancient Scholar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2646460/00e4b561de451918cdba6f0f2c8cb67c5123a731.jpg"},{"name":"Saint Scholar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2646460/2120e826df242c42e6f6386567cbc1476114825d.jpg"},{"name":"Rainforest Hiking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2646460/6ba64b7a448147b7652ff6f27347d943ed961632.jpg"},{"name":"Hill Hiking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2646460/3b6d453d572d8ed040e5ab48f4448ba88df19c76.jpg"}],"total":91},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2646460?t=1772803538","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2646460?t=1772803538","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/1452351ac65b2f4252d2f10c877aa14f8e8730f5/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_28.jpg?t=1772803538","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/1452351ac65b2f4252d2f10c877aa14f8e8730f5/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_28.jpg?t=1772803538","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>About Soulmask: Shifting Sands</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This is not the Egypt that you know from history books.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter &quot;Soulmask: Shifting Sands,&quot; a realm where ancient Egypt meets undiscovered technology. Break the laws of gravity: pilot everything from humble wooden boats to massive soaring citadels. Customize your boats and claim the heavens in this multidimensional world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/dd23d4148f5f844527f9a44577dc3b99.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" width=720 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/dd23d4148f5f844527f9a44577dc3b99.webm?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/dd23d4148f5f844527f9a44577dc3b99.mp4?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of the Egyptian gods through your Mask\u2014raise the dead, summon the sun, and wield divine strength beyond imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your city in the sky, reclaim the power of the gods, and uncover new truths of life, death, and immortality.</p></p><br><h1>1.0 Update Content</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/fbff737b0a41f9ab1eadd6511484b4d5.avif?t=1772803538\" width=1080 height=2082 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Join Us On Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/072e14cd6fe6a46f8127158523d3d8a1.webp?t=1772803538\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/072e14cd6fe6a46f8127158523d3d8a1.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" class=\"bb_img\" width=615 height=96 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/99ccba9d57ba671853bfcadfa83adb6f.avif?t=1772803538\" width=614 height=194 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Soulmask V1.0 &amp; 'Shifting Sands' DLC will Arrive globally on April 10, 2026!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/5ab8d1170979625018b70395caea4044.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" width=614 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/5ab8d1170979625018b70395caea4044.webm?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/5ab8d1170979625018b70395caea4044.mp4?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulmask is a massive survival crafting game set in  multidimensional ancient civilization open worlds. Carve your path through two unique realms\u2014[Cloud Mist Forest] or [Shifting Sands]. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a survivor whose soul is tied to a mysterious mask. To survive this world, you must recruit the strongest barbarians, using the masks to possess and lead them toward a new era of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/17d1c32a5bb84691b70bb0044653ef01.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" width=614 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/17d1c32a5bb84691b70bb0044653ef01.webm?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/17d1c32a5bb84691b70bb0044653ef01.mp4?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Barbarians with Unique Talents</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Soulmask, no two souls are alike. With over 400 unique Talents, Masteries, and Likes, your tribesmen offer infinite possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From bloodthirsty warriors and lethal hunters to legendary craftsmen and master harvesters\u2014recruit them all. Transfer your consciousness through the mask to possess any tribesman, transforming them into your ultimate avatar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 1.0 update allows your barbarians to share their wisdom. Train your tribesmen and pass down skills to forge the ultimate, one-of-a-kind warrior.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/72ea7b55c35eaac1906be9dff753b302.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" width=614 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/72ea7b55c35eaac1906be9dff753b302.webm?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/72ea7b55c35eaac1906be9dff753b302.mp4?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Production, Tribe Management &amp; Base Building</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrace the ascent of civilization: from humble thatch huts to impenetrable blackstone forts. Watch as your small settlement evolves into a majestic city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the first seeds of agriculture to the roar of machinery\u2014experience the true evolution of civilization in Soulmask through farming, beekeeping, weaving, leatherworking, smelting, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not walk this path alone. With a sophisticated command system, your tribesmen can automate every task. From gathering raw materials to managing logistics and assembly lines, you can design and transform your home into a fully automated industrial powerhouse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/63206c48b4e1241326a072a8552c3a08.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" width=614 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/63206c48b4e1241326a072a8552c3a08.webm?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/63206c48b4e1241326a072a8552c3a08.mp4?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Masks and Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the Mask is a symbol of the gods. Each Mask grants a unique combat style, while the Mimicry System lets you embody a deity to turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 9 weapon classes, 88 weapon skills, and the infinite traits of your tribesmen, each battle is a thrilling test of skill to be experienced as you fight for survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/83c537121e6e820921a0f96eb03ed283.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" width=614 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/83c537121e6e820921a0f96eb03ed283.webm?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/83c537121e6e820921a0f96eb03ed283.mp4?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Massive Ancient Open World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore two ancient worlds spanning great distances, each with unique climates and ecosystems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rainforests, deserts, snow-capped mountains, plateaus, and islands that you must adapt to... or perish. Each environment demands different strategies for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for treasure in ancient ruins, battle mechanical enemies in labyrinths, or take on entire barbarian cities alone. This world is yours to challenge and explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/73c04340f3bfa11b9338f1b42d907ff3.poster.avif?t=1772803538\" width=614 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/73c04340f3bfa11b9338f1b42d907ff3.webm?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/extras/73c04340f3bfa11b9338f1b42d907ff3.mp4?t=1772803538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your gameplay, Your experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom is at the heart of Soulmask.  Single-player play, LAN(Co-op), Private, or Official Servers, over 200 customizable settings allow you to craft a world that is uniquely yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In v1.0, we introduce three distinct playstyles: Tribe Mode for the builders and leaders; Survival Mode for the purists; and Warrior Mode for those who seek the thrill of brutal combat. Choose your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Steam Workshop and everyone can now unleash their creativity with our powerful Soulmask Modkits to craft a Soulmask experience unlike any other.</p></li></ul>","developers":["CampFire Studio"],"dlc":[3966020,3731990,3575860,3336600],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646460/d87f71b13e1fda6cfbd17958f7a0373caa42c6e5/header_alt_assets_28.jpg?t=1772803538","is_free"